WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.040
It starts small. A prompt you can't quite type.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:07.880
So you press a key, and say it out loud.

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:12.620
And it's... just there. Cleaner than you said it.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:14.440
Weird, at first.

00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:20.202
Day one, it feels strange. Talking to your laptop. Day two, you

00:00:20.202 --> 00:00:24.603
forget. Day three, you catch yourself pressing the key before you've decided

00:00:24.603 --> 00:00:24.970
to.

00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:29.613
By the end of the week, you talk to everything. Email. Code

00:00:29.613 --> 00:00:32.070
comments. That message you've been putting off.

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:37.124
You even start giving it instructions. Tucky, make this an email. And

00:00:37.124 --> 00:00:39.050
it does. In your voice.

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:41.950
That's the moment you can't go back.

00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:48.485
Then one evening, you open the library. Every thought you spoke this

00:00:48.485 --> 00:00:53.169
week is sitting there. Searchable. And you wonder... if my thoughts are

00:00:53.169 --> 00:00:53.950
worth keeping...

00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:56.680
what about my conversations?

00:00:57.200 --> 00:01:01.585
So the next call, you let it listen. Live transcript. A guide

00:01:01.585 --> 00:01:05.240
that tracks what you've covered, and nudges the next question.

00:01:05.700 --> 00:01:09.490
And when you hang up, the decisions and follow-ups are already written.

00:01:11.200 --> 00:01:15.755
Weeks go by. Meetings, notes, a screen recording you narrated for a

00:01:15.755 --> 00:01:19.550
client. It all lands in one place, sorted by project.

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:23.627
So you ask it. What did we decide on pricing with Acme?

00:01:23.627 --> 00:01:26.650
And it answers. And shows you where it came from.

00:01:27.100 --> 00:01:31.230
Every morning: what happened, what matters, what's next.

00:01:32.800 --> 00:01:36.937
One last question. Where does all of this live? Here. On your

00:01:36.937 --> 00:01:39.350
Mac. No account. No cloud. No subscription.

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:41.390
Free.

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:47.730
It started with one key. Typing is overrated. Just talk.
